on advancedPage (pta=nil) {
	«Display the Advanced sitePrefs page and handle commands.
		«This page allows you to edit:
			«Navigation
			«Template
			«Cascading Style Sheets
			«JavaScript
			«Colors
			«Custom Prefs
		«11/8/99; 3:48:32 PM by PBS
	«Changes:
		«6/30/05; 2:59:37 AM by JES
			«Removed the action attribute from the <form> tag. We're always POSTing to ourselves, so it was unnecessary. Also, with the new iframe-based advanced prefs page, this was causing the page loaded from a POST to use the incorrect template.
		«3/2/04; 1:47:03 PM by JES
			«Added template for current navigation item, in the navigation appearance section.
		«7/10/03; 5:18:21 PM by JES
			«Added robots.txt editor.
		«4/28/03; 1:17:12 PM by JES
			«Added checkbox for displaying an Edit button next to the site's navigation links: Defaults to checked.
			«Localized prompt for Use Home Page Template.
		«4/20/03; 4:38:56 PM by JES
			«Added External Style Sheet section.
		«2002:
			«1/25/02; 6:10:51 PM by PBS
				«Performance enhancements in the local "add" routine -- add a trailing semicolon; use parentheses to get the expression in x = x + y form (which is optimized by the kernel).
		«2001:
			«10/2/01; 1:05:13 PM by PBS
				«Allow the user to edit the print-friendly template.
			«9/6/01; 3:23:15 PM by PBS
				«The area for editing Navigation Appearance was too small for complex designs.
			«03/23/01; 6:07:03 PM by PBS
				«HTML errors in the Navigation Appearance section were fixed. There was a missing tr tag, and the type attribute was missing from the input fields.
			«03/20/01; 6:30:23 PM by PBS
				«When there's XML an error in the navigation, site structure, or custom prefs, and when the page returned with an error, the text inside the textarea for that item was messed up. Quotes appeared as &quot;, for instance. This has been fixed.
		«2000:
			«01/17/00; 5:15:28 PM by PBS
				«Preliminary support for editing in Pike.
			«02/11/00; 3:20:40 PM by PBS
				«Custody support: don't allow objects to be edited if they're being edited in Pike.
			«03/27/00; 5:07:24 PM by PBS
				«Allow the newsArchiveLink macro in the news day template.
			«04/09/00; 5:31:56 PM by PBS
				«Add help text to the news day template section regarding the newsArchiveLink macro.
			«05/09/00; 12:36:51 PM by JES
				«second attempt at localization
			«05/22/00; 7:16:32 PM by JES
				«various small bug fixes related to confirm boxes
			«05/29/00; 9:09:19 PM by JES
				«fixed problem where new member signup page would revert the top section to English on non-english sites
			«06/05/00; 3:52:46 PM by PBS
				«New block of prefs: Themes. You can make your site cloneable and choose name for your theme.
			«06/11/00; 3:28:48 AM by JES
				«Merged Brent's theme prefs code.
				«Localized Themes panel.
			«07/22/00; 4:04:51 PM by PBS
				«Localization bug fix -- the custom sign up wizard wasn't being created in the site when the custom prefs changed.
			«10/14/00; 12:56:36 PM by PBS
				«New Home Page Template allows one to use an alternate template for just the home page.
			«10/25/00; 7:07:41 PM by PBS
				«Don't enforce navigator links macro for home page template.
			«10/31/00; 5:58:15 PM by JES
				«basicXmlPost passes in the manilaLanguageTableAddress as part of the site attributes when restoring an item to the default.
			«11/26/00; 7:48:24 PM by PBS
				«The external editor button connects to the local HTTP server, which then requests the object from the Manila server.
		«1999:
			«12/10/99; 10:40:52 AM by PBS
				«The News Day Template allows you to edit the mini-templates for each day of news when rendering more than one day of news on the home page.
			«12/12/99; 5:55:26 PM by PBS
				«Navigation Appearance is a new section. You can edit the appearance of your navigation. Two items are editable: the item format, which is the format of each item, and separator format, which is the HTML that separates each item. With this feature you can create horizontal navigation, or add characters of some kind (like the | character) between items, or do <br> separators, or whatever.
			«12/13/99; 5:40:31 PM by PBS
				«Confirm boxes respect the editor's choice of colors.
			«12/13/99; 10:17:37 PM by PBS
				«Fixed bug when restoring the template to the default: you might get a siteName not defined message. Now you won't.
			«12/14/99; 2:54:47 PM by PBS
				«The calendar formatting can now be customized via the Advanced page.
			«12/15/99; 3:00:29 PM by PBS
				«Both states of the Members box are now editable templates.
			«12/21/99; 8:03:56 PM by PBS
				«Get the separator colors by calling manilaSuite.html.getSeparatorColors, a new bottleneck script.
	
	if pta == nil {
		pta = html.getPageTableAddress ()};
	pta^.title = manilaSuite.getString ("admin.advancedPageTitle", pta: pta);
	
	«05/10/00 JES: get the localized version of the page's name in the URL
	«local (advancedPageName = string.lower (string.innerCaseName (pta^.title)))
	local (advancedPageName = pta^.pathArgs);
	
	local (separatorColor, separatorTextColor);
	manilaSuite.html.getSeparatorColors (@separatorColor, @separatorTextColor);
	
	local (navList = {});
	local (sectionName);
	local (htmlText = "");
	local (indentLevel = 0);
	local (adrSite = manilaSuite.getSiteAddress ());
	local (adrNewsSite = manilaSuite.getNewsSiteAddress ());
	local (headerColor, headerTextColor, backgroundColor, backgroundTextColor);
	bundle { //PBS 12/13/99: get the Admin Box color preferences
		manilaSuite.html.getAdminBoxColors (@headerColor, @headerTextColor, @backgroundColor, @backgroundTextColor)};
	local (flContentEditor = false);
	if not pta^.flManagingEditor {
		flContentEditor = pta^.flContentEditor;
		if not flContentEditor {
			scriptError (manilaSuite.getString ("admin.cantDisplayPageNoPermission", pta: pta))}};
	
	local (flMemberHasPike = manilaSuite.pike.memberHasPike (pta));
	
	local (argTable);
	new (tableType, @argTable);
	if pta^.searchArgs != "" {
		local (ix);
		local (searchArgs = pta^.searchArgs);
		ix = string.patternMatch ("#", searchArgs);
		if ix > 0 {
			searchArgs = string.delete (searchArgs, ix, infinity)};
		webserver.parseArgs (searchArgs, @argTable)};
	
	on add (s) {
		htmlText = htmlText + (string.filledString ("\t", indentLevel) + s + "\r");};
	
	on getShortSectionName () {
		return (string.lower (string.dropNonAlphas (sectionName)))};
	on getDisplayName () { // 05/10/00 JES: get a localized section name for display
		try {
			return (manilaSuite.getString ("admin." + string.innerCaseName (sectionName) + "SectionName", pta: pta))}
		else {
			return (sectionName)}};
	on addSeparator () {
		add ("<a name=\"" + string.lower (string.dropNonAlphas (sectionName)) + "\"></a>");
		indentLevel++;
		add ("<table cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\"><tr>");
		indentLevel++;
		add ("<td bgcolor=\"" + separatorColor + "\"><font color=\"" + separatorTextColor + "\"><b>" + getDisplayName () + "</b></font></td>");
		indentLevel--;
		add ("</tr></table><p>");
		indentLevel--;
		navList = navList + sectionName;
		return (true)};
	on addDescription (text) {
		add (text + "<p>");
		return (true)};
	on addTable () {
		indentLevel++;
		add ("<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"7\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">");
		indentLevel++;
		return (true)};
	on addFormStart () {
		local (formName = getShortSectionName ());
		indentLevel++;
		«add ("<form method=\"POST\" action=\"" + pta^.fname + "$" + advancedPageName + "#" + formName + "\">")
		add ("<form method=\"POST\">");
		return (true)};
	on endSection () {
		add ("</table>");
		indentLevel--;
		add ("</form>");
		indentLevel--;
		indentLevel--;
		indentLevel--;
		return (true)};
	on addButtons (adrObject, flPikeButton=true, pikeHelpDescription="") {
		add ("<tr><td valign=\"top\" align=\"left\">");
		if flPikeButton and flMemberHasPike {
			local (editInPikeUrl = "editInPike?" + string.urlEncode (sectionName));
			local (appendTable);
			new (tableType, @appendTable);
			local (itemType = sectionName);
			if string.lower (itemType) == "cascading style sheet" {
				itemType = "CSS"};
			appendTable.itemType = string.dropNonAlphas (itemType);
			editInPikeUrl = manilaSuite.pike.buildPikeButtonUrl (adrObject, "editAdvancedItem", @appendTable);
			add ("&nbsp;&nbsp;" + manilaSuite.pike.pikeButton (editInPikeUrl, adrObject, pta^.adrMemberInfo, adrSite, false, pikeHelpDescription, pta))}
		else {
			add ("&nbsp;")};
		add ("</td>");
		add ("<td valign=\"top\" align=\"right\">");
		indentLevel++;
		add ("<input type=\"submit\" name=\"restoreToDefault\" value=\"" + manilaSuite.getString ("admin.restoreDefaultButton", pta: pta) + "\">");
		add ("<input type=\"submit\" value=\"&nbsp;" + manilaSuite.getString ("common.submitButton", pta: pta) + "&nbsp;\">");
		add ("</td></tr>");
		indentLevel--;
		return (true)};
	on addErrorMessage (message) {
		add ("<font color=\"red\">" + message + "</font><p>");
		return (true)};
	on addSuccessMessage (message) {
		add ("<font color=\"darkblue\">" + message + " " + mainResponder.localization.dateTimeString (manilaSuite.convertTime (pta: pta), pta: pta) + "</font><p>");
		return (true)};
	on exportOutline (s) {
		s = string.replaceall (s, "\t", "  ");
		s = string.replaceall (s, "&", "&amp;");
		s = string.replaceall (s, "<", "&lt;");
		s = string.replaceall (s, ">", "&gt;");
		return (s)};
	on tdLabel (label="") {
		if label == "" {
			label = sectionName};
		add ("<td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" width=\"300\">" + label + "</td>");
		return (true)};
	on tdValue (prefName, default) {
		local (value);
		value = manilaSuite.getNewsSitePref (prefName, default:default, flCreate:true, flUntaint:true);
		add ("<td valign=\"top\" align=\"left\">");
		add ("<input name=\"" + prefName + "\" value=\"" + value + "\" size=\"10\">");
		add ("</td>");
		return (true)};
	on wasThisFormPosted () {
		local (expectedFormName = string.lower (string.dropNonAlphas (sectionName)));
		if defined (pta^.postArgs.no) { //while technically a post, no means don't restore to default, so pretend this was a GET
			return (false)};
		if defined (pta^.postArgs.[expectedFormName]) {
			return (true)};
		return (false)};
	on textArea (name=nil, value=nil, cols=nil, rows=nil, colspan="2", leadingSpaces="&nbsp;&nbsp;") {
		if name == nil {
			name = string.lower (string.dropNonAlphas (sectionName))};
		if value == nil {
			value = ""};
		if cols == nil {
			cols = 70};
		if rows == nil {
			rows = 10};
		
		value = string.replaceAll (value, "\"", "&quot;");
		add ("<td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" colspan=\"" + colspan + "\">");
		indentLevel++;
		add (leadingSpaces + "<textarea name=\"" + name + "\" cols=\"" + cols + "\" rows=\"" + rows + "\">" + value + "</textarea>");
		add ("</td>");
		indentLevel--;
		
		return (true)};
	on addConfirmBox (message) { //add a restore-to-default confirmation box
		if defined (pta^.postArgs.restoreToDefault) { //confirm restoring this item to its default state
			local (action = pta^.fname + "$" + advancedPageName + "#" + getShortSectionName ());
			action = manilaSuite.unTaint (action);
			local (s);
			s = "\r<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"3\" cellspacing=\"1\" bgcolor=\"" + headerColor + "\" width=\"350\">";
			s = s + "\r<tr bgcolor=\"" + headerColor + "\"><td align=\"left\"><b><font color=\"" + headerTextColor + "\">Confirm</font></b></td></tr>\r<tr bgcolor=\"" + backgroundColor + "\"><td>";
			s = s + "<form method=\"POST\" action=\"" + action + "\">";
			s = s + message + "<br>";
			s = s + "<font color=\"" + backgroundTextColor + "\"><p align=\"right\">";
			s = s + "<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"" + getShortSectionName () + "\" value=\"true\">";
			s = s + "<input type=\"submit\" name=\"no\" value=\"&nbsp;&nbsp;" + manilaSuite.getString ("common.noButton", pta: pta) + "&nbsp;&nbsp;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;";
			s = s + "<input type=\"submit\" name=\"doRestoreDefault\" value=\"&nbsp;" + manilaSuite.getString ("common.yesButton", pta: pta) + "&nbsp;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p></font></form>";
			s = s + "</td></tr></table><br><br>";
			s = s + "</form>";
			add ("<center>" + s + "</center>");
			return (true)}; //true because a confirm box was added
		return (false)}; //didn't need to add a confirm box
	on basicPost (displayName, shortName, adrObject, adrCreateScript, flPost) {
		«CSS, JavaScript.
		local (replacementTable); new (tableType, @replacementTable);
		replacementTable.displayName = displayName;
		if flPost { //handle the command
			if not (manilaSuite.custody.memberCanCheckOutObject (adrObject, pta^.adrMemberInfo, pta^.adrSiteRootTable, false)) { //false because it's an advanced item
				addErrorMessage (manilaSuite.getString ("admin.cantEditCheckedOutItemError", @replacementTable, pta: pta))}
			else {
				if not (addConfirmBox (manilaSuite.getString ("admin.restoreDefaultConfirmText", @replacementTable, pta: pta))) {
					if defined (pta^.postArgs.doRestoreDefault) { //restore to default
						local (siteInfo);
						new (tableType, @siteInfo);
						siteInfo.adrSite = adrSite;
						adrCreateScript^ (@siteInfo);
						mainResponder.redirect (pta^.fname + "$" + advancedPageName + "?" + shortName + "=1#" + shortName)}
					else { //update 
						local (s = string (pta^.postArgs.[shortName]));
						s = string.replaceAll (s, lf, "");
						wp.newTextObject (s, adrObject);
						«Refresh the page.
						mainResponder.redirect (pta^.fname + "$" + advancedPageName + "?" + shortName + "=2#" + shortName)}}}};
		
		if defined (argTable.[shortName]) { //search args are used to signify a success message through a refresh/redirect
			local (flEndsWithS = (shortName endsWith "s"));
			case argTable.[shortName] {
				"1" {
					if flEndsWithS {
						addSuccessMessage (manilaSuite.getString ("admin.restoredDefaultSuccessPlural", @replacementTable, pta: pta))}
					else {
						addSuccessMessage (manilaSuite.getString ("admin.restoredDefaultSuccessSingular", @replacementTable, pta: pta))}};
				"2" {
					if flEndsWithS {
						addSuccessMessage (manilaSuite.getString ("admin.updatedSuccessPlural", @replacementTable, pta: pta))}
					else {
						addSuccessMessage (manilaSuite.getString ("admin.updatedSuccessSingular", @replacementTable, pta: pta))}}}};
		
		return (true)};
	on basicXmlPost (displayName, shortName, adrObject, adrCreateScript, flPost, adrVal, adrStructure=nil) {
		«Navigation, custom prefs, hierarchy.
		if flPost { //handle the command
			local (replacementTable); new (tableType, @replacementTable);
			replacementTable.displayName = displayName;
			if not (manilaSuite.custody.memberCanCheckOutObject (adrObject, pta^.adrMemberInfo, pta^.adrSiteRootTable, false)) { //false because it's an advanced item
				addErrorMessage (manilaSuite.getString ("admin.cantEditCheckedOutItemError", @replacementTable, pta: pta))}
			else {
				if not (addConfirmBox (manilaSuite.getString ("admin.restoreDefaultConfirmText", @replacementTable, pta: pta))) {
					if defined (pta^.postArgs.doRestoreDefault) { //restore to default
						local (siteInfo);
						new (tableType, @siteInfo);
						siteInfo.adrSite = adrSite;
						siteInfo.manilaLanguageTableAddress = manilaSuite.getLanguageTableAddress (pta); //10/31/00 JES: tell create scripts what language the site is using.
						adrCreateScript^ (@siteInfo);
						if shortName endsWith "s" {
							addSuccessMessage (manilaSuite.getString ("admin.restoredDefaultSuccessPlural", @replacementTable, pta: pta))}
						else {
							addSuccessMessage (manilaSuite.getString ("admin.restoredDefaultSuccessSingular", @replacementTable, pta: pta))};
						adrVal^ = exportOutline (string (adrObject^))}
					else { //try to update
						local (s = string (pta^.postArgs.[shortName]));
						s = string.replaceAll (s, lf, "");
						s = manilaSuite.unTaint (s);
						local (t);
						try {
							xml.compile (s, @t);
							wp.newTextObject (s, adrObject);
							adrVal^ = exportOutline (string (adrObject^));
							if shortName endsWith "s" {
								addSuccessMessage (manilaSuite.getString ("admin.updatedSuccessPlural", @replacementTable, pta: pta))}
							else {
								addSuccessMessage (manilaSuite.getString ("admin.updatedSuccessSingular", @replacementTable, pta: pta))};
							if adrStructure != nil {
								xml.compile (s, adrStructure)}}
						else {
							replacementTable.tryError = tryError;
							if shortName endsWith "s" {
								addSuccessMessage (manilaSuite.getString ("admin.couldntUpdateBecausePlural", @replacementTable, pta: pta))}
							else {
								addSuccessMessage (manilaSuite.getString ("admin.couldntUpdateBecauseSingular", @replacementTable, pta: pta))};
							adrVal^ = exportOutline (s)}}}}}; //PBS 03/20/01: the carets need to be escaped
		
		return (true)};
	
	bundle { //add a meta tag
		«This page should expire immediately, it should never be cached. For this to work, the template should include the {meta} safe macro.
		
		local (s = "<META HTTP-EQUIV=\"Expires\" CONTENT=\"Mon, 01 Jan 1990 01:00:00 GMT\">");
		
		if defined (pta^.meta) {
			pta^.meta = pta^.meta + "\r" + s} //add to existing meta info
		else {
			pta^.meta = s}}; //create new meta info in the page table
	
	if flContentEditor { //PBS 12/03/01: get localized Navigation page title
		pta^. title = manilaSuite.getString ("admin.NavigationSectionName", pta: pta);
		pta^.navigator = @pta^.adrSiteRootTable^.["#navigator"]}; //use site navigator
	add ("<h2>" + pta^.title + "</h2>");
	if not flContentEditor {
		add (manilaSuite.getString ("admin.advancedPageDescription", pta: pta) + "<p>");
		add ("[navText]<p>")}; //this will get replaced later
	
	bundle { //Navigation
		sectionName = "Navigation";
		local (shortName = getShortSectionName ());
		local (adrObject = @adrSite^.["#navigator"].outline);
		local (value = exportOutline (string (adrObject^)));
		local (flPost = wasThisFormPosted ());
		if not flContentEditor {
			addSeparator ()};
		
		basicXmlPost (getDisplayName (), shortName, adrObject, @manilaSuite.newSite.createNavigator, flPost, @value);
		if flPost {
			if not defined (pta^.postArgs.flNavigatorEditButton) {
				pta^.newsSite^.flNavigatorEditButton = false}
			else {
				pta^.newsSite^.flNavigatorEditButton = true}};
		
		local (description = manilaSuite.getString ("admin.navigationSectionDescription", pta: pta));
		local (adrTemplate = @adrSite^.["#template"]);
		if not (string.lower (string (adrTemplate^)) contains "{navigatorlinks}") {
			description = description + manilaSuite.getString ("admin.navigationRequiresNavLinksMacro", pta: pta)};
		addDescription (description);
		
		addFormStart ();
		addTable ();
		
		add ("<tr>");
		indentLevel++;
		textArea (value:value);
		add ("</tr>");
		
		bundle { //checkbox for displaying Edit button next to navigator
			add ("<tr>");
			indentLevel++;
			add ("<td colspan=\"2\">");
			indentLevel++;
			
			local (prompt = manilaSuite.getString ("admin.navEditButtonCheckPrompt"));
			local (flChecked = manilaSuite.getNewsSitePref ("flNavigatorEditButton", adrSite, default:true, flCreate:true) );
			if flChecked {
				add ("<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"flNavigatorEditButton\" checked> " + prompt)}
			else {
				add ("<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"flNavigatorEditButton\"> " + prompt)};
			add ("</td>");
			indentLevel--;
			add ("</tr>")};
		addButtons (adrObject, true, manilaSuite.getString ("admin.editNavigationWithPike", pta: pta));
		
		endSection ()};
	if not flContentEditor { //PBS 12/03/01: content editors see navigation only
		bundle { //Template
			sectionName = "Template";
			local (shortName = getShortSectionName ());
			local (adrObject = @adrSite^.["#template"]);
			local (value = exportOutline (string (adrObject^)));
			local (flPost = wasThisFormPosted ());
			addSeparator ();
			
			local (replacementTable); new (tableType, @replacementTable);
			replacementTable.displayName = getDisplayName ();
			
			if flPost { //handle the command
				if not (manilaSuite.custody.memberCanCheckOutObject (adrObject, pta^.adrMemberInfo, pta^.adrSiteRootTable, false)) { //false because it's an advanced item
					addErrorMessage (manilaSuite.getString ("admin.cantEditCheckedOutItemError", @replacementTable, pta: pta))}
				else {
					if not (addConfirmBox (manilaSuite.getString ("admin.confirmTemplateRestoreToDefault", pta: pta))) {
						if defined (pta^.postArgs.doRestoreDefault) { //restore to default
							local (siteInfo);
							new (tableType, @siteInfo);
							siteInfo.adrSite = adrSite;
							siteInfo.siteName = nameOf (adrSite^); //PBS 12/13/99: fix for siteName not defined error
							«manilaSuite.newSite.createTemplate (@siteInfo)
							manilaSuite.themes.restoreTemplate (@siteInfo);
							local (successMessage = manilaSuite.getString ("admin.templateHasBeenRestoredToDefault", pta: pta));
							mainResponder.redirect (pta^.fname + "$" + advancedPageName + "?" + shortName + "=1#" + shortName)}
						else { //try to update the template
							local (s = string (pta^.postArgs.[shortName]));
							s = string.replaceAll (s, lf, "");
							local (errorString);
							if manilaSuite.admin.isGoodTemplate (s, @errorString) {
								s = mainResponder.neuterText (s, true, false);
								wp.newTextObject (s, adrObject);
								«Refresh the page.
								local (successMessage = manilaSuite.getString ("admin.templateUpdateSuccess", pta: pta));
								mainResponder.redirect (pta^.fname + "$" + advancedPageName + "?" + shortName + "=2#" + shortName)}
							else {
								addErrorMessage (errorString)}}}}};
			
			if defined (argTable.[shortName]) { //search args are used to signify a success message through a refresh/redirect
				case argTable.[shortName] {
					"1" {
						addSuccessMessage (manilaSuite.getString ("admin.restoredDefaultSuccessSingular", @replacementTable, pta: pta))};
					"2" {
						addSuccessMessage (manilaSuite.getString ("admin.updatedSuccessSingular", @replacementTable, pta: pta))}}};
			
			addDescription (manilaSuite.getString ("admin.templateSectionDescription", pta: pta));
			addFormStart ();
			addTable ();
			
			add ("<tr>");
			indentLevel++;
			textArea (value:value, rows:30);
			add ("</tr>");
			addButtons (adrObject, true, manilaSuite.getString ("admin.editTemplateWithPike", pta: pta));
			
			endSection ()};
		bundle { //Home Page Template
			sectionName = "Home Page Template";
			local (shortName = getShortSectionName ());
			local (adrObject = @adrSite^.["#homePageTemplate"]);
			if not defined (adrObject^) {
				wp.newTextObject ("", adrObject)};
			local (value = exportOutline (string (adrObject^)));
			local (flPost = wasThisFormPosted ());
			addSeparator ();
			
			local (replacementTable); new (tableType, @replacementTable);
			replacementTable.displayName = getDisplayName ();
			
			if flPost { //handle the command
				if not (manilaSuite.custody.memberCanCheckOutObject (adrObject, pta^.adrMemberInfo, pta^.adrSiteRootTable, false)) { //false because it's an advanced item
					addErrorMessage (manilaSuite.getString ("admin.cantEditCheckedOutItemError", @replacementTable, pta: pta))}
				else {
					if not (addConfirmBox (manilaSuite.getString ("admin.confirmHomePageTemplateRestoreToDefault", pta: pta))) {
						if defined (pta^.postArgs.doRestoreDefault) { //restore to default -- default is empty
							wp.newTextObject ("", adrObject);
							pta^.newsSite^.flUseHomePageTemplate = false; //turn off template
							local (successMessage = manilaSuite.getString ("admin.templateHasBeenRestoredToDefault", pta: pta));
